{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31750","headline":"寄刘栖楚 · 贾岛","name":"寄刘栖楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"趋走与偃卧，去就自殊分。\n当窗一重树，上有万里云。\n离披不相顾，髣髴类人羣。\n友生去更远，来书绝如焚。\n蝉吟我爲听，我歌蝉岂闻。\n岁暮傥旋归，晤言桂氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}